#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kolorlines; is a simple but highly addictive, one player game for &kde;. "
"&kolorlines; has been inspired by well known game of <application>Color "
"Lines</application>, written for <application>DOS</application>, by Olga "
"Demina, Igor Ivkin and Gennady Denisov back in 1992."
msgstr ""
"&kolorlines; je prosta alo vrlo privlačna igra, za jednog igrača pod &kde;. "
"&kolorlines; je inspirisana poznatom igrom <application>Color Lines</"
"application>, koju su napisali za <application>DOS</application>, Olga "
"Demina, Igor Ivkin i Gennady Denisov još 1992."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The goal of &kolorlines; is quite plain. The player has to move the colored "
"balls around the game board, gathering them into the lines of the same color "
"by five. Once the line is complete it is removed from the board, therefore "
"freeing precious space. In the same time the new balls keep arriving by "
"three after each move, filling up the game board."
msgstr ""
"Cilj &kolorlines;  je sasvim običan. Igrač mora pomijeriti obojene loptice "
"oko table za igru, skupljajući ih u liniji istih boja po pet. Kad jednom "
"linija bude završena izbacuje se sa table, i tako oslobođa prostor. U isto "
"vrijeme nove loptice dolaze po tri nakon svakog pokreta, popunjavajući tablu "
"za igru."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kolorlines; cannot be won, and is played against the high score "
"exclusively. The game ends once the whole game board is filled up with balls."
msgstr ""
"&kolorlines; se ne može pobijediti, i igra je protiv najvecih rezultata. "
"Igra se završava kad čitava tabla bude prekrivena lopticama."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to Play"
msgstr "Kako se igra"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "Objective:"
msgstr "Objektiv:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Move the colored balls around the game board, gathering them into the lines "
"of the same color by five."
msgstr ""
"Pomicati obojene loptice oko table za igru, okupljajući ih u linijama sa "
"istim bojama po pet."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When &kolorlines; starts you are presented with the game board split into 81 "
"squares (the game board is 9x9 squares), and right away three new colored "
"balls appear on the board. Use your mouse to move the balls from cell to "
"cell to group them into the lines of the same color. However, after each of "
"your moves the computer drops three more marbles onto the board. To avoid "
"filling up the board you should gather the balls into lines of 5 or more "
"balls. When such a line is complete, the balls are removed from the field "
"and your score grows."
msgstr ""
"Kad &kolorlines; počne imate tablu podijeljenu na 81 dio (tabla igre je 9x9) "
"i odmah se pojavljuju tri nove obojene loptice. Koristite svoj miš da bi "
"pomijerili loptice od ćelije do ćelije da ih grupišete u linije istih boja. "
"Kakogod, nakon svakog vašeg pokreta računar dodaje tri klikera na tablu. Da "
"bi izbjegli tablu morate skupljati loptice u linijama od 5 ili vise loptica. "
"Kada takva linija bude popunjena, loptice se pomjeraju iz polja i vaš "
"rezultat raste."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:77 index.docbook:79 index.docbook:96 index.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "Note:"
msgstr "Bilješka:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The new balls will not be added to the field after a line removal. Instead "
"you will be rewarded with yet another move before a new triplet of balls is "
"added."
msgstr ""
"Nove loptice neće biti dodane na polju igre poslije pomeranja linije. "
"Umjesto toga bićete nagrađeni sa novim potezom prije nego se nova trojka "
"loptica dodaje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "The increase in score depends solely on the amount of the erased balls."
msgstr "Porast rezultata ovisi isključivo o količini izbrisanih loptica."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:79 index.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are playing with <guimenuitem>Show Next</guimenuitem> feature enabled "
"the increase in score is less than if <guimenuitem>Show Next</guimenuitem> "
"feature is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Ako igrate sa <guimenuitem>Show Next</guimenuitem>omogućenom funkcijom "
"povećanje u rezultatu je manje od <guimenuitem>Show Next</guimenuitem> "
"katakteristika je onemogućena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kolorlines; cannot be won, and is played against the high score "
"exclusively. The game ends once the whole game board becomes filled up with "
"balls."
msgstr ""
"&kolorlines; se ne može osvojiti, i igra se protiv najvecih rezultata. Igra "
"završava kad ćitava tabla za igru bude popunjena sa lopticama."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Rules, Strategies and Tips"
msgstr "Pravila igre, strategije i savjeti"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Rules"
msgstr "Pravila Igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After each player’s move the game will add three more balls to the board."
msgstr "Nakon poteza svakog od igrača u igru će se dodati tri loptice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To free up the space on the board player has to group the balls of the same "
"color into an uninterrupted horizontal, vertical, or diagonal line by five "
"or more."
msgstr ""
"Da se oslobodi prostor na tabli igrač treba grupisati loptice istih boja u "
"neprekinuti horizontalnu, vertikalnu, ili dijagonalnu liniju po pet ili više."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To initiate the move simply click on the source ball to select it, then "
"click on the destination square to complete the move."
msgstr ""
"Da biste pokrenuli ovaj potez jednostavno kliknite na izvornu lopticu da je "
"odaberete, a zatim kliknite na kvadrat odredišta da zavrsite potez."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A ball can only be moved into the squares that are vacant and not occupied "
"by any other ball."
msgstr ""
"Loptica se jedino može pomijerati u kvadratima koji su napušteni i nisu "
"zauzeti sa drugim lopticama."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "In the same time the square in question must be freely accessible."
msgstr "U isto vrijeme kvadrat u pitanju mora biti slobodno dostupan."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The square is freely accessible when there are no other balls blocking the "
"path to it."
msgstr ""
"Kvadrat je slobodno dostupan kada nema drugih loptica koje blokiraju put do "
"njega."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The path is considered blocked if any part of it is currently being occupied "
"by a ball."
msgstr ""
"Put se smatra blokiranim ako je bilo koji dio zahvaćen od strane loptice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:96
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In &kolorlines; the path is automatically calculated by the game. If there "
"is no possible (open) route to the destination cell, a friendly notification "
"will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"U &kolorlines; put se automatski izračunava od strane igre. Ako ne postoji "
"mogući (otvoreni) put do destinacijske ćelije, prijateljska obavijest ce "
"izaći."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In order to successfully transfer a ball to a desired cell where the path is "
"blocked to, player has to clear the path first."
msgstr ""
"Da bi uspješno prebacili lopticu na željenu ćeliju u kojoj je put blokiran, "
"igrač treba prvo očistiti put."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To clear the path the player simply has to move all the blocking balls out "
"of the way, therefore freeing the route."
msgstr ""
"Da bi očistio put igrač treba pomijeriti sve loptice koje blokiraju put, i "
"tako osloboditi rutu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The scores are awarded for each line of balls removed off the game board."
msgstr "Bodovi se dodjeljuju za svaku liniju loptica uklonjenih sa table igre."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid "Strategies and Tips"
msgstr "Strategije i savjeti"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Keep a close look on the bar showing the next three marbles to be dropped "
"onto the field (unless <guimenuitem>Show Next</guimenuitem> feature is "
"disabled). More often then not you will appreciate the information if "
"provides."
msgstr ""
"Držiti pogled na traci jer pokazuje sljedeća tri klikera koji će biti "
"spušteni na polje (osim <guimenuitem>Show Next</guimenuitem> funkcija "
"onemogućena). Češće nego inače ćete cijeniti informaciju koja se pruža."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Try to keep at least a half of the game board cleared. Letting the balls to "
"pile up will almost certainly lead to a loss."
msgstr ""
"Pokušajte zadržati barem pola table igre čistom. Dopustiti da se loptice "
"gomilaju će gotovo sigurno dovesti do gubitka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To make your game easier always keep more than one line of the same balls "
"ready for clearing. This can be achieved by building the consecutive lines "
"of the same balls everywhere possible, instead of concentrating on one line "
"at a time."
msgstr ""
"Da bi olakšali svoju igru uvijek drži više od jedne linije istih loptica "
"spremnih za čiščenje. To se može postići kroz izgradnju uzastopnih redova "
"istih loptica na svim mogućim mjestima, umjesto da se skoncentrišete na "
"jednoj po jednoj liniji."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Try to keep more than three almost completed lines existing on the game "
"board at all times. Almost completed means that they are four same balls in "
"length, and only one ball remains until their completion."
msgstr ""
"Pokušajte sačuvati vise od tri gotovo završenih linija loptica na tabli igre "
"u svakom trenutku. Gotovo završene znači da su četiri iste loptice u dušini, "
"i da samo jedna loptica nedostaje do završetka."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "Primjer:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have an almost completed line and the pathway to it suddenly becomes "
"blocked with another ball, don’t just move that ball. Try to find a sequence "
"of the balls of the same kind that you can continue with the moved ball. If "
"such sequence exists and is accessible – then move the blocking ball there."
msgstr ""
"Ako imate gotovo završenu liniju i put bude blokiran sa drugom lopticom, "
"nemojte samo pomijeriti lopticu. Pokušajte pronaći niz loptica iste vrste sa "
"kojima možete nastaviti sa pomijerenom lopticom. Ako takav niz postoji i ako "
"je pristupačan - onda pomijeriti lopticu koja blokira tamo."

