"<shortcut><keycap>Space</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Navigacija</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Izaberi</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:215
#, no-c-format
msgid "This action will select the item currently under the cursor."
msgstr "Ova akcija će selektovati stavku koja je ispod kursora."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:219
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show Next</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Prikaži sljedeće</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:223
#, no-c-format
msgid "Toggles the information on next marbles."
msgstr "Uključuje informaciju o sljedećem."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:227
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally &kolorlines; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> "
"and <guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for more information read the "
"sections about the <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings"
"\">Settings Menu</ulink> and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-"
"help\">Help Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"Dodatno &kolorlines; ima standardne &kde; stavke menija <guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu> i <guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu>, za više informacija pročitajte  sekcije "
"o <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Meniju Postavki</"
"ulink> i <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\">Meniju Pomoći</"
"ulink> od &kde; osnova."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:236
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "Najčešća pitanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:241
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr "Želim promijeniti izgrled igrice. Mogu li?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:242
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To change &kolorlines; visual theme you can use "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kolorlines;..."
"</guimenuitem></menuchoice> option on the menubar."
msgstr ""
"Da. Da bi promijenili &kolorlines; vizualnu temu možete koristiti "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kolorlines;..."
"</guimenuitem></menuchoice> opciju na menubar."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:245
#, no-c-format
msgid "I don't want to make any moves right now. Can I skip a turn?"
msgstr "Ne želim napraviti nijedan potez sada. Mogu li preskočiti potez?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To skip a turn you can use a <link linkend=\"menu-move-endturn"
"\">keyboard shortcut</link>, or a <link linkend=\"menu-move-endturn"
"\">menubar</link> option."
msgstr "Da. Da preskičite potez možete koristiti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use the keyboard to play the game?"
msgstr "Mogu li koristiti tastaturu za igranje igre?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. You can use the cursor keys and the <keycap>Space</keycap> key to "
"select and set the balls."
msgstr "Da. Možete koristiti kursor tipke i."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:253
#, no-c-format
msgid "I cannot figure out what to do here! Are there hints?"
msgstr "Ne mogu da shvatim šta da radim ovdje! Postoje li naznake?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:254
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. &kolorlines; does not have a <quote>Hint</quote> feature."
msgstr "Ne. &kolorlines; nema <quote>Hint</quote> svojstvo."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:257
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have to quit the game now, but I am not finished yet. Can I save my "
"progress?"
msgstr ""
"Moram napustiti igru, ali još uvijek nisam završio. Mogu li sačuvati svoj "
"napredak?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:258
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kolorlines; does not have a <quote>Save</quote> feature at the moment."
msgstr "&kolorlines;  nema <quote>Save</quote> svojstvo trenutno."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:263
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracije igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:264
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kolorlines; configuration dialog allows you to select &kolorlines; visual "
"themes."
msgstr ""
"&kolorlines; dijalog konfiguracije dozvoljava vam da odaberete &kolorlines; "
"vizualne teme."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:265
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To select a new theme simply choose the theme from the selection list. Each "
"item in the list shows a small preview left to the theme name. A selection "
"is immediately applied."
msgstr "Da odaberete novu temu jednostavno odaberite temu sa liste."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:267
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once you are satisfied with the theme you have selected you can click the "
"<guibutton>Close</guibutton>, located at the bottom part of this dialog."
msgstr ""
"Kad budete zadovoljni temom koju ste odabrali možete kliknuti "
"<guibutton>Close</guibutton>, nalazi se u donjem dijelu ovog dijaloga."

